  "html": "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull prototype-main about-prototype has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide editorial-section editorial-grid is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading screen-reader-text\">About</h1>\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group cv-section-heading screen-reader-text is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-79fb870f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-index\">Biography</h2>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group cv-biography is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-image cv-biography__media\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/portfolio-theme/assets/images/cv/po-hao-chen-performance.webp\" alt=\"PO HAO CHEN 現場演出，操作電子音樂設備\" width=\"903\" height=\"1143\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group cv-biography__content is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading cv-biography__name\">PO HAO CHEN</h3>\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cv-biography__role wp-block-paragraph\">MUSIC PRODUCER / SOUND ARTIST</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group cv-biography__copy is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">畢業於國立臺南藝術大學應用音樂學系工程與創作組，曾任智冠科技音樂製作人，現以獨立音樂工作者身分投入配樂、音樂製作、現場演出與跨域展演。合作與製作經歷包括香港 Madhead《神魔之塔》、日本 SEGA、台鋼獵鷹、台鋼天鷹、公視金 V 獎，以及多位 VTuber 與歌手；2026 年初亦擔任歌手 E1and 專場演出的音樂總監，負責整體音樂策劃與演出統籌。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">近年積極參與聲音藝術與跨領域創作，曾於聲響藝術節演出。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">目前主要從事詞曲創作、編曲、配唱製作、吉他與貝斯演奏、混音、現場音樂總監、現場音樂執行及音樂教學等工作。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t<div id=\"cv-placeholder\" class=\"wp-block-group alignwide editorial-section editorial-grid cv-timeline is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group cv-section-heading screen-reader-text is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-79fb870f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-index\">Selected Experience</h2>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"cv-arrangement\" data-cv-arrangement>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"cv-arrangement__pin\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cv-arrangement__stage\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cv-arrangement__view\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cv-arrangement__track\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cv-arrangement__block\" data-year=\"2026\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cv-experience__year\">2026</h3>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cv-experience__list\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><span class=\"cv-experience__description\"><span class=\"cv-experience__title\">趙亭婷 × 安娜琪舞蹈劇場《KINGDOM》</span> <span class=\"cv-experience__roles\">聲音設計暨聲響執行</span></span></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><span class=\"cv-experience__description\"><span class=\"cv-experience__title\">子午計畫 【沉珀 Aetris】微光 Glimmer</span> <span class=\"cv-experience__roles\">作曲、編曲、吉他</span></span></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><span class=\"cv-experience__description\"><span class=\"cv-experience__title\">金V獎主題曲</span> <span class=\"cv-experience__roles\">配唱製作人</span></span></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><span class=\"cv-experience__description\"><span class=\"cv-experience__title\">E1and Special Showcase《WONDE1AND》</span> <span class=\"cv-experience__roles\">音樂總監、Programmer、Band Leader、音樂編曲</span></span></li>\